    <aside id="medals"><div class="eyebrow"><span>Medal table</span><span id="medalsSub">tonight</span></div><div id="medalsBody"><p class="empty">No medals yet. Play a game or start Sports Day — the top three take gold, silver and bronze.</p></div></aside>
  </section>

